<!-- ============ Architecture ============ -->
<section id="s3">
<h2 id="architecture"><span class="sec-num">§3</span>系統架構圖</h2>

<p>整條 reasoning 路徑跨後端 streaming pipeline 與前端 React tree。<strong>綠色 = 新增、藍色 = 修改、灰色 = 未變動</strong>。<em>任一張 diagram 點下去都可以放大、拖曳、滾輪縮放。</em></p>

<h4 style="margin-top: 18px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--fg-muted);">Backend Pipeline</h4>
<div class="mermaid-panel">
<div class="mermaid">
flowchart LR
    FE([Frontend<br/>SSE consumer]):::ext
    Orch[Orchestrator<br/>.astream_run]:::mod
    Mapper[StreamEventMapper<br/>content_blocks dispatch]:::mod
    Seg[ReasoningSegmenter<br/>sentence boundary +<br/>80-char CJK fallback]:::new
    DE[DomainEvents<br/>+ ReasoningStatus]:::mod
    SSE[SSESerializer<br/>+ data-reasoning-status]:::mod
    Cb[ReasoningTraceCallback<br/>on_llm_end → metadata.reasoning]:::new
    Abort[_handle_abort_cleanup<br/>D35 protocol]:::mod
    LF1[(Langfuse GENERATION<br/>metadata.reasoning)]:::ext
    LF2[(Langfuse CHAIN<br/>status=aborted +<br/>reasoning_tail_aborted)]:::ext

    Orch -->|v2 astream chunks| Mapper
    Mapper -->|feed delta| Seg
    Seg -->|yield sentence| Mapper
    Mapper --> DE
    DE --> SSE
    SSE -->|SSE wire| FE
    Orch -->|inject callback| Cb
    Cb --> LF1
    Orch -.->|CancelledError| Abort
    Abort --> LF2

    classDef new fill:#ecf7ee,stroke:#1f7a3a,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1f7a3a
