<h3 id="reasoning-flow">跟一句 reasoning 走過整條路：8 步</h3>

<p>以下是一個 reasoning sentence（例如「Looking at Q3 revenue trends...」）從 LLM 進入 backend、切句、走 SSE 到 frontend 顯示、同時被寫進 Langfuse trace metadata 的完整 timeline。Step 3、4、7 是 PR 新增的核心邏輯，標 hot。</p>

<div class="mermaid-panel">
<div class="mermaid">
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant LLM as Provider LLM
    participant LC as LangChain<br/>(content_blocks)
    participant Map as StreamEventMapper
    participant Seg as ReasoningSegmenter
    participant Cb as ReasoningTraceCallback
    participant SSE as SSE Serializer
    participant FE as ChatPanel / hook
    participant UI as ReasoningIndicator
    participant LF as Langfuse GENERATION

    LLM->>LC: stream reasoning + text blocks
    LC->>Map: AIMessageChunk.content_blocks
    Note over Map: type=="reasoning"<br/>→ _handle_reasoning_block
    Map->>Seg: feed(delta)
    Seg-->>Map: yield "Looking at Q3..."
    Map-->>SSE: ReasoningStatus event
    SSE-->>FE: data: {"type":"data-reasoning-status",<br/>"transient":true, ...}
    FE->>UI: setReasoningStatusText("Looking at Q3...")
    UI-->>UI: render streaming mode<br/>(text + dots cycler)

    Note over LLM,LF: turn 結束時
    LC->>Cb: on_llm_end(LLMResult)
    Cb->>LF: handler._runs[run_id].update(<br/>metadata={"reasoning": joined})
</div>
</div>

<div class="steps">

  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-badge">1</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">Provider streams chunks <span class="range">(unchanged)</span></div>
      <p>OpenAI / Anthropic / Gemini 透過 LangChain async client 串 chunk 出來。重點：每家把 reasoning 放的位置不同（OpenAI Responses 用 summary block、Anthropic 用 thinking block、Gemini 用 thought block），但 LangChain v1 把它們都正規化成 <code>content_blocks[*]</code> 含 <code>{type: "reasoning", reasoning: "..."}</code>。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-badge">2</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">backend/agent_engine/streaming/event_mapper.py <span class="range">_handle_messages</span></div>
      <p>Chunk 進來，先檢查 <code>msg_chunk.id</code> 跟前一個比 — 不同就是 LLM-call 邊界，flush segmenter 殘留 + reset。然後 iterate <code>content_blocks</code>，按 <code>type</code> dispatch 到對應 handler（reasoning / text / tool_call_chunk）。<strong>這是 PR 的核心 fix</strong>，從讀 plain string 改成讀 normalized blocks。</p>
      <details class="snippet">
        <summary>show source</summary>
<pre>blocks = self._apply_dev_flag_block_filters(msg_chunk.content_blocks)
prev_block_type: str | None = None
for block in blocks:
    block_type = block.get("type")
    if block_type == "reasoning":
        self._handle_reasoning_block(block, events,
            prepend_separator=(prev_block_type == "reasoning"))
    elif block_type == "text":
        self._handle_text_block(block, events)
    elif block_type == "tool_call_chunk":
        self._handle_tool_call_chunk_block(block, events)
    prev_block_type = block_type</pre>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step hot">
    <div class="step-badge">3</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">backend/agent_engine/streaming/reasoning_segmenter.py <span class="range">feed()</span></div>
      <p>Reasoning text 是 stream chunk 形式（一個 chunk 可能 3 個字、可能整句），不能直接逐 chunk 推到前端 — 視覺會閃爆。<code>ReasoningSegmenter</code> 累積 buffer，碰到半形 <code>.!?</code> + 空白、全形 <code>。！？</code>、或 <code>\n</code> 切一句；如果累積 80 字還沒終結符（CJK fallback — Gemini 中文 reasoning 常常一句到底沒標點），soft-emit 整段並 reset。<strong>不能放 frontend</strong> — 不該把語言邏輯塞進 React。</p>
      <details class="snippet">
        <summary>show source</summary>
<pre>def feed(self, delta: str) -> Iterator[str]:
    self._buffer += delta
    pieces = _split_into_sentences(self._buffer)
    for sentence in pieces[:-1]:
        if sentence: yield sentence
    remainder = pieces[-1]
    if len(remainder) >= self.SOFT_EMIT_CHAR_THRESHOLD:  # 80 chars
        yield remainder
        self._buffer = ""
    else:
        self._buffer = remainder</pre>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step hot">
    <div class="step-badge">4</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">backend/agent_engine/streaming/event_mapper.py <span class="range">_handle_reasoning_block</span></div>
      <p>Mapper 拿到 segmenter yield 的完整 sentence，包成 <code>ReasoningStatus</code> domain event。同個 LLM call 內所有 reasoning blocks 共用同一個 <code>reasoning_id</code>（lazy-mount），所以前端可以 <code>setText</code> 在同一個 indicator 上更新而不是 append 多條。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-badge">5</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">backend/agent_engine/streaming/sse_serializer.py <span class="range">_(event: ReasoningStatus)</span></div>
      <p>Domain event 序列化為 SSE wire format：<code>data: {"type":"data-reasoning-status","id":"reasoning-0","data":{"text":"..."},"transient":true}\n\n</code>。<strong><code>transient: true</code> 是契約核心</strong> — AI SDK v6 看到這個 flag 不會塞進 <code>message.parts</code>，所以 reasoning 永遠不會 persist 到 transcript。Dev/CI 環境下 serializer 會 assert 這個 flag 存在；prod 改寫 warning log（避免一個 bug 把整個服務 500）。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-badge">6</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">frontend/src/hooks/useReasoningStatus.ts <span class="range">handleData</span></div>
      <p>AI SDK v6 把 <code>data-*</code> 透過 <code>onData</code> 給 <code>useReasoningStatus.handleData</code>。Hook 先檢查兩個 race guard（<code>clearedRef</code> / <code>finishedRef</code>）— 都沒鎖才 <code>setText</code>。同時更新 <code>lastUpdateAtRef</code> 給 stalled 計時器用（10s 沒新 chunk 就視覺降階）。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step hot">
    <div class="step-badge">7</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">frontend/src/lib/reasoning-indicator-logic.ts <span class="range">resolveReasoningDisplayText</span></div>
      <p>純 selector，三段優先序：(1) 真實 reasoning text → 直接 verbatim；(2) streaming + last part 是已完成的 tool → 顯示 idle text「Synthesizing」（填 3-7 秒 post-tool synthesis 空窗，否則 reviewer 會以為畫面壞了）；(3) 其他 → null。設計成 pure function 才能單測，不混 hook 狀態。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="step">
    <div class="step-badge">8</div>
    <div class="step-body">
      <div class="step-loc">frontend/src/components/atoms/ReasoningIndicator.tsx <span class="range">render</span></div>
      <p>同一個 <code>.reasoning-status</code> 容器渲染四種視覺：3-dot idle / text + cycler streaming / 半透明 + STOPPED frozen-with-text / 純 STOPPED frozen-no-text。共用同高（vertical-slot 對齊），mode 切換不會畫面跳動。永遠掛 <code>aria-hidden="true"</code>，SR 由獨立的 <code>LiveStatusAnnouncer</code> 負責。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<p style="margin-top: 18px; color: var(--fg-soft);"><strong>平行軌道（同個 LLM call 結束時）：</strong>LangChain dispatch <code>on_llm_end</code> 給 <code>ReasoningTraceCallback</code>，從 <code>response.generations[0][0].message.content_blocks</code> 撈 reasoning blocks join 起來，透過 <code>handler._runs[run_id]</code> 找到正在收尾的 Langfuse GENERATION，呼叫 <code>.update(metadata={"reasoning": joined})</code>。用 <code>_runs</code> 不用 <code>update_current_generation()</code> 是因為 async dispatch 下 OTel current-span 不一定接得到。詳見 §6.2 hotspot。</p>

<!-- =========================================================== -->
<!-- ============ BACKEND ============ -->
<!-- =========================================================== -->

</section>

<section id="s4">
<h2 id="backend"><span class="sec-num">§4</span>Backend Walkthrough</h2>

<!-- ----------- ReasoningStatus ----------- -->
<h3 id="reasoning-status"><code>ReasoningStatus</code> domain event &amp; wire format</h3>

<p>
  整條 pipeline 把 reasoning 當成一個獨立 channel 處理，不混進 <code>text-*</code>。
  新增的 dataclass 跟其他 domain events 一樣是 frozen value object，意義是「在 <code>reasoning_id</code> 這個 LLM call 內，最新可顯示的一句 reasoning 摘要」。
  搭配 SSE 上 <strong><code>transient: true</code></strong> flag — AI SDK v6 看到 <code>transient</code> 不會塞進 <code>message.parts</code>，所以這些事件永遠不會被 persist 進 transcript。
</p>

<div class="diff-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/streaming/domain_events_schema.py</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+7</span>
      <span class="stat rem">−0</span>
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre data-diff data-lang="python">@@ -55,6 +55,12 @@ class ToolProgress:
     data: dict


+@dataclass(frozen=True)
+class ReasoningStatus:
+    reasoning_id: str
+    text: str
+
+
 @dataclass(frozen=True)
 class StreamError:
     error_text: str
@@ -81,6 +87,7 @@ DomainEvent = (
     | ToolResult
     | ToolError
     | ToolProgress
+    | ReasoningStatus
     | StreamError
     | Finish
 )</pre>
</div>

<div class="diff-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/streaming/sse_serializer.py</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+33</span>
      <span class="stat rem">−0</span>
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre data-diff data-lang="python">@@ -8,10 +8,13 @@ from __future__ import annotations

 import functools
 import json
+import logging
+import os

 from backend.agent_engine.streaming.domain_events_schema import (
     Finish,
     MessageStart,
+    ReasoningStatus,
     StreamError,
@@ -22,11 +25,24 @@ from backend.agent_engine.streaming.domain_events_schema import (
     ToolResult,
 )

+logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)
+

 def _sse(payload: dict) -> str:
     return f"data: {json.dumps(payload)}\n\n"


+# D39.c: reasoning events must always carry transient=True.
+def _assert_reasoning_transient(payload: dict) -> None:
+    if not (payload.get("type", "").startswith("data-reasoning-")
+            and payload.get("transient") is True):
+        msg = "reasoning SSE event missing transient=True flag"
+        if os.environ.get("APP_ENV", "").lower() == "production":
+            logger.warning(msg, extra={"payload_type": payload.get("type")})
+        else:
+            raise AssertionError(msg)
+
+
 @functools.singledispatch
 def serialize_event(event) -> str:
     raise TypeError(f"Unhandled event type: {type(event).__name__}")
@@ -94,6 +110,26 @@ def _(event: ToolProgress) -> str:
     })


+@serialize_event.register
+def _(event: ReasoningStatus) -> str:
+    payload = {
+        "type": "data-reasoning-status",
+        "id": event.reasoning_id,
+        "data": {"text": event.text},
+        "transient": True,
+    }
+    # DEV-ONLY: FORCE_REASONING_NON_TRANSIENT strips the transient flag so
+    # the wire emits a malformed payload. Production must NOT set it.
+    if os.environ.get("FORCE_REASONING_NON_TRANSIENT"):
+        payload.pop("transient", None)
+    _assert_reasoning_transient(payload)
+    return _sse(payload)
+
+
 @serialize_event.register
 def _(event: StreamError) -> str:
     return _sse({"type": "error", "errorText": event.error_text})</pre>
</div>

<div class="callout">
  <span class="label">為什麼需要 assert</span>
  <code>transient: true</code> 是 wire-format contract 的核心 — 一旦 dev 改錯，所有 reasoning text 都會被當成 persistent part 進 transcript，
  甚至污染後續 history replay。assert 在 dev/CI 立刻 raise；prod 改寫 warning log 是安全降級，避免一個 wire-format bug 直接讓 production 500。
</div>

<!-- ----------- Segmenter ----------- -->
<h3 id="segmenter"><code>ReasoningSegmenter</code> — sentence-boundary + 80-char CJK fallback</h3>

<p>
  Gemini 中文 reasoning <strong>幾乎不打 <code>。</code></strong> — 整段 thinking 可能一個 terminator 都沒有，
  buffer 會無限累積、frontend 一個字都看不到。所以這顆 segmenter 同時處理三種斷句訊號：
</p>
<ul>
  <li>half-width <code>.!?</code> + 空白（避免切到 <code>3.14</code>，用 lookbehind 排除）</li>
  <li>full-width CJK 標點 <code>。！？</code> + 換行 <code>\n</code> — 不需要尾隨空白</li>
  <li><strong>80-char soft-emit fallback</strong> — buffer 累積到 80 字還沒 terminator，整段 emit、buffer 清空（D26）</li>
</ul>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/streaming/reasoning_segmenter.py</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+120</span>
      <span class="badge new">+ new file</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-python">_HALF_WIDTH_BOUNDARY = re.compile(r"(?&lt;!\d)[.!?](\s)")  # (?<!\d) 防 3.14
_IMMEDIATE_BOUNDARY = re.compile(r"[。！？\n]")


class ReasoningSegmenter:
    SOFT_EMIT_CHAR_THRESHOLD = 80  # D26 — Gemini 繁中無 。 時的保險絲

    def __init__(self) -> None:
        self._buffer: str = ""

    def feed(self, delta: str) -> Iterator[str]:
        self._buffer += delta
        pieces = _split_into_sentences(self._buffer)

        for sentence in pieces[:-1]:        # 所有完整句子 yield
            if sentence:
                yield sentence

        remainder = pieces[-1]
        if len(remainder) >= self.SOFT_EMIT_CHAR_THRESHOLD:
            yield remainder                 # 80 字未斷句 → soft emit
            self._buffer = ""
        else:
            self._buffer = remainder

    def flush(self) -> str | None:
        """abort / stream end 時叫一次，把殘留尾段拿出來。"""
        content = self._buffer or None
        self._buffer = ""
        return content</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="callout warn">
  <span class="label">設計取捨</span>
  Segmenter 故意放 backend — frontend 不該嵌入語言邏輯（CJK 標點、半形全形對照）。
  搭配 D28 <em>hold-and-flush</em>（看到 text-block 之前先 emit 殘留 reasoning），保證 frontend 拿到的 sequence 是
  <code>[..., ReasoningStatus(tail), TextStart, TextDelta]</code>。
</div>

<!-- ----------- StreamEventMapper ----------- -->
<h3 id="event-mapper"><code>StreamEventMapper</code> — rewire to <code>content_blocks</code></h3>

<p>
  舊版 mapper 讀 <code>chunk.content</code>（plain string），Gemini 改成 list-of-blocks 後直接吃癟。
  改完之後 mapper 走 <strong>LangChain v1 normalized <code>content_blocks</code></strong> — 三家 provider 都正規化成同一種 list，
  每個 block 有 <code>type</code> 是 <code>text</code> / <code>reasoning</code> / <code>tool_call_chunk</code>。
</p>

<div class="diff-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/streaming/event_mapper.py · _handle_messages</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+24</span>
      <span class="stat rem">−5</span>
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre data-diff data-lang="python">@@ -62,17 +88,42 @@ class StreamEventMapper:
         if isinstance(msg_chunk, ToolMessage):
             return events

+        # D27.1: chunk.id transitions are LLM-call boundaries — flush any
+        # buffered reasoning tail under the prior reasoning_id, reset
+        # segmenter, and arm a new reasoning_id for the next reasoning
+        # block. id=None is treated as continuation.
+        if msg_chunk.id is not None and msg_chunk.id != self._current_llm_call_id:
+            self._flush_segmenter_into(events)
+            self._segmenter.reset()
+            self._current_llm_call_id = msg_chunk.id
+            self._current_reasoning_id = None
+
         if not self._message_started:
             events.append(MessageStart(message_id=msg_chunk.id, session_id=self._session_id))
             self._message_started = True

-        if msg_chunk.content:
-            if not self._text_block_open:
-                self._current_text_id = self._next_text_id()
-                events.append(TextStart(text_id=self._current_text_id))
-                self._text_block_open = True
-            events.append(TextDelta(text_id=self._current_text_id, delta=msg_chunk.content))
+        # Iterate the LangChain v1 normalized content_blocks (D1). The lazy
+        # property handles all three providers' raw shapes.
+        blocks = self._apply_dev_flag_block_filters(msg_chunk.content_blocks)
+        prev_block_type: str | None = None
+        for block in blocks:
+            block_type = block.get("type")
+            if block_type == "reasoning":
+                self._handle_reasoning_block(
+                    block, events, prepend_separator=(prev_block_type == "reasoning")
+                )
+            elif block_type == "text":
+                self._handle_text_block(block, events)
+            elif block_type == "tool_call_chunk":
+                self._handle_tool_call_chunk_block(block, events)
+            prev_block_type = block_type

+        # Backup path — some providers' content_blocks may not surface
+        # tool_call_chunks; the legacy attribute keeps the tool path alive.
         if getattr(msg_chunk, "tool_call_chunks", None):
             if self._text_block_open:
                 events.append(TextEnd(text_id=self._current_text_id))</pre>
</div>

<div class="callout warn">
  <span class="label">關鍵 diff 解讀</span>
  下方 5 行 <code>−</code> 是<strong>整段被刪掉</strong>的舊邏輯 — 原本直接讀 <code>msg_chunk.content</code>（plain string），Gemini / Anthropic 的 list-of-blocks 完全沒處理到。
  上方 24 行 <code>+</code> 是新的 <code>content_blocks</code> dispatch loop，三家 provider 都正規化過、各 block 自己 route 到對應 handler。
</div>

<div class="review-bubble note">
  <div class="anchor">_handle_messages · LLM-call boundary check</div>
  <span class="rb-label">note</span>
  <strong><code>msg_chunk.id != self._current_llm_call_id</code> 為什麼是 boundary 訊號？</strong>
  LangChain v2 stream 在多回合 tool flow 下會分多次 chat-model invocation，每次的 <code>AIMessageChunk.id</code> 不同。某些 provider 在中間 chunk 會 emit <code>id=None</code>（continuation），所以判斷式有 <code>msg_chunk.id is not None</code> 守門。如果忘了 flush，前一輪 LLM call 的 reasoning 殘留會被算到下一輪 — bug 不會炸但會把 trace metadata 弄混。
</div>

<div class="review-bubble note">
  <div class="anchor">_handle_messages · 連續 reasoning blocks 的 <code>\n</code> separator</div>
  <span class="rb-label">note</span>
  <strong>為什麼 <code>prepend_separator</code> 是 <code>prev_block_type == "reasoning"</code>？</strong>
  OpenAI Responses 一個 chunk 偶爾會 emit 多個 reasoning block（multi-summary explode）。沒 separator 兩段會在 segmenter buffer 內黏死。塞 <code>\n</code> 不只是視覺分隔 — 它本身是 immediate terminator，會強制前段以完整 <code>ReasoningStatus</code> emit。</div>

<p>三件事比較細微但都關鍵：</p>

<ol>
  <li><strong>LLM call boundary 偵測：</strong>同一 turn 內可能有多次 chat-model call（多回合 tool flow），每次 <code>msg_chunk.id</code> 會變。邊界要 flush，否則上一輪 LLM 的 reasoning 尾段會被誤算到下一輪。</li>
  <li><strong>連續 reasoning blocks 加 <code>\n</code> separator（D12）：</strong>OpenAI Responses API 一個 chunk 可能塞多個 reasoning block（multi-summary explode），不加 separator 會兩個 summary 黏在一起；<code>\n</code> 本身是 immediate terminator，會強制把前段以 <code>ReasoningStatus</code> emit 出來。</li>
  <li><strong>D28 hold-and-flush：</strong><code>_handle_text_block</code> 與 <code>_handle_tool_call_chunk_block</code> 開頭都先呼叫 <code>_flush_segmenter_into(events)</code>，確保 reasoning 殘留先到 frontend，再開始送 text。</li>
</ol>

<div class="diff-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/streaming/event_mapper.py · finalize()</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+9</span>
      <span class="stat rem">−0</span>
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre data-diff data-lang="python">@@ -133,7 +280,14 @@ class StreamEventMapper:
         return []

     def finalize(self) -> list[DomainEvent]:
+        if self._finalized:
+            return []
+        self._finalized = True
         events: list[DomainEvent] = []
+        # D34: reasoning may be the last block of the last LLM call with no
+        # terminator and no following text/tool. flush() here closes that
+        # gap so the buffer is never lost.
+        self._flush_segmenter_into(events)
         if self._text_block_open:
             events.append(TextEnd(text_id=self._current_text_id))
             self._text_block_open = False</pre>
</div>

<!-- ----------- ReasoningTraceCallback ----------- -->
<h3 id="trace-callback"><code>ReasoningTraceCallback</code> — per-LLM-call Langfuse metadata</h3>

<p>
  這顆 callback 訂閱 LangChain <code>on_llm_end</code>（chat-model 完成事件由它送，不是 <code>on_chat_model_end</code>），
  把每次 LLM call 的最終 <code>AIMessage.content_blocks</code> 內的 reasoning text join 起來，寫到對應的 Langfuse <strong>GENERATION span</strong> 上的 <code>metadata.reasoning</code>。
</p>

<div class="callout warn">
  <span class="label">為什麼不用 update_current_generation()</span>
  原本 prototype 是叫 <code>client.update_current_generation()</code>，依賴 OTel context 找「當前 span」。
  問題是 LangChain async dispatch 路徑下，callback frame 的 OTel context 不一定接得到 GENERATION span，
  很多時候是 <code>None</code> 或上層 CHAIN，導致 update silently no-op。
  改用 <strong>lookup-by-run_id</strong> — 直接從 <code>handler._runs[run_id]</code>（Langfuse 4.x 內部 dict）拿 GENERATION 物件，避開 OTel context 漂移。
</div>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/streaming/reasoning_trace_callback.py</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+229</span>
      <span class="badge new">+ new file</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-python">class ReasoningTraceCallback(BaseCallbackHandler):
    SIZE_CAP_BYTES = 500_000             # D29.2
    UNSUPPORTED_SENTINEL = "&lt;unsupported&gt;"
    METADATA_KEY = "reasoning"
    run_inline = True                    # 寫進 metadata 必須在 generation 結束 span 之前

    def on_llm_end(self, response: LLMResult, *, run_id: UUID, **kwargs):
        try:
            value = self._compute_reasoning_value(response)
        except Exception:
            logger.exception("ReasoningTraceCallback failed; emitting empty string")
            value = ""

        if self._handler is not None:
            generation = self._lookup_generation_by_run_id(run_id)
            if isinstance(generation, LangfuseGeneration):
                generation.update(metadata={self.METADATA_KEY: value})
                return
            logger.warning("run_id %s not found in handler._runs ...", run_id)

        # legacy / unit-test fallback — 仰賴 OTel current-span，async 可能 no-op
        self._client.update_current_generation(metadata={self.METADATA_KEY: value})</code></pre>
</div>

<p><strong>D29 schema — 完成路徑下 <code>metadata.reasoning</code> 的 5 種 value 狀態：</strong></p>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>狀態</th><th>條件</th><th>value</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>有 reasoning</td><td>capability ∈ {on, off} 且 message 含 reasoning block</td><td>joined text (<code>"\n".join</code>)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>無 reasoning</td><td>capability ∈ {on, off} 但 message 沒 reasoning block</td><td><code>""</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>不支援</td><td>capability == "unsupported"（如 gemini-1.5）</td><td><code>"&lt;unsupported&gt;"</code> sentinel</td></tr>
    <tr><td>過大</td><td>joined 超過 500KB UTF-8</td><td>truncate + suffix <code>... [truncated, original {N} bytes]</code></td></tr>
    <tr><td>extraction 失敗</td><td>任何 exception → 防禦性 fallback</td><td><code>""</code> (always-write-key contract)</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">reasoning_trace_callback.py · _lookup_generation_by_run_id</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge new">+ new helper</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-python">def _lookup_generation_by_run_id(self, run_id: UUID) -> Any:
    """三層 fallback 防 Langfuse SDK 把 key 從 UUID 改成 str / hex."""
    runs = self._handler._runs
    observation = runs.get(run_id)             # 1. 當前契約 — UUID key
    if observation is not None:
        return observation
    observation = runs.get(str(run_id))         # 2. 字串化 drift
    if observation is not None:
        self._warn_drift_once("str(uuid)")
        return observation
    observation = runs.get(run_id.hex)          # 3. 無 dash hex drift
    if observation is not None:
        self._warn_drift_once("uuid.hex")
        return observation
    return None</code></pre>
</div>

<!-- ----------- Abort cleanup ----------- -->
<h3 id="abort-cleanup"><code>_handle_abort_cleanup</code> — D35 user-abort 後寫尾段</h3>

<p>
  使用者按 Stop 時，LangChain 的 <code>on_chat_model_end</code> callback <strong>不會 fire</strong>（in-flight LLM API call 被 cancel），
  所以 <code>ReasoningTraceCallback</code> 沒機會寫 <code>metadata.reasoning</code>。
  這個 cleanup helper 直接從 <code>handler._runs</code> 找最近的 in-flight GENERATION，把 segmenter 殘留尾段寫到 <code>metadata.reasoning_tail_aborted</code>（<strong>注意：用不同的 key</strong>），
  並把 root CHAIN 標 <code>status="aborted"</code>。
</p>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/agents/base.py · _handle_abort_cleanup</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge new">+ new method</span>
      <span class="badge modified">in modified file</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-python">def _handle_abort_cleanup(self, mapper, handler):
    """D35 abort cleanup — sync by design (sync code 不會被 CancelledError 打斷)."""
    from langfuse import LangfuseChain, LangfuseGeneration

    tail_segments: list[str] = []
    try:
        for event in mapper.finalize():
            if isinstance(event, ReasoningStatus):
                tail_segments.append(event.text)
    except Exception:
        logger.exception("mapper.finalize raised during abort cleanup")

    # 為什麼用 .values() 而不是 _lookup_generation_by_run_id：
    # 這裡 enumerate 整個 dict 的 value，對 key shape (UUID / str / hex) drift 免疫，
    # 只有 observation type drift 會壞 isinstance — 由 contract test 守住。
    in_flight_generation = None
    root_chain = None
    for observation in handler._runs.values():
        if isinstance(observation, LangfuseGeneration):
            in_flight_generation = observation
        elif isinstance(observation, LangfuseChain) and root_chain is None:
            root_chain = observation                    # parent_run_id is None 那個是 root

    if in_flight_generation is not None:
        in_flight_generation.update(
            metadata={"reasoning_tail_aborted": "\n".join(tail_segments)},
        )                                               # 空 buffer → 寫 "" 也算寫過
    if root_chain is not None:
        root_chain.update(metadata={"status": "aborted"})</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="callout danger">
  <span class="label">Hotspot — D29 schema 違反</span>
  D29 原始 spec 寫「<code>metadata.reasoning</code> key 永遠存在於每個 chat_model span」（always-write-key），
  但 abort 路徑下我們寫的是 <strong>另一個 key</strong> <code>reasoning_tail_aborted</code>。
  briefing.md §1 已標記這需要把 D29 升級成 <em>mode-aware</em> contract（completed 必填 / aborted optional / status 條件存在）。
  Operator 查 trace 時必須記得 abort 路徑要抓不同 key。<a href="#hotspot-d29">詳見 Review Hotspots §6.1</a>。
</div>

<div class="review-bubble blocking">
  <div class="anchor">base.py · _handle_abort_cleanup · L570-577</div>
  <span class="rb-label">Blocking discussion</span>
  <strong>用 <code>handler._runs.values()</code> 直接 iterate Langfuse 內部 dict — 私 API 依賴，SDK 升級會炸。</strong>
  目前的緩解是 <code>test_langfuse_runs_contract.py</code> 在 CI 跑真實 Langfuse 的 <code>on_chain_start</code> / <code>on_chat_model_start</code>，斷言 UUID key shape + concrete observation type，drift 就失敗。請 reviewer 確認：(a) Langfuse 版本是否 pin 上限（<code>pyproject.toml</code> minor 鎖死）？(b) contract test 是否被排進 CI 必跑？看 §6.2 hotspot。
</div>

<div class="review-bubble note">
  <div class="anchor">base.py · _handle_abort_cleanup · sync function</div>
  <span class="rb-label">note</span>
  <strong>為什麼 cleanup 不寫 async？</strong>
  <code>asyncio.CancelledError</code> 只會打斷 await 點。整個 cleanup 用 sync code 寫就保證執行到完（不會被 cancellation propagation 中途打斷），這是 D35 的明文約定。所有 Langfuse 寫入都用 try/except — 即使 observability outage 也不會把 cancellation propagation 卡住。</div>

<!-- ----------- Provider switch ----------- -->
<h3 id="provider-switch"><code>_init_model</code> — provider-aware reasoning kwargs</h3>

<p>三個 provider 啟用 reasoning 的 kwarg <strong>完全不同</strong>，<code>_init_model</code> 統一把 <code>ModelConfig.reasoning</code> + <code>thinking_budget</code> 翻譯成各家 SDK 認得的字串：</p>

<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Provider</th><th>reasoning=&quot;on&quot;</th><th>reasoning=&quot;off&quot;</th><th>備註</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>google_genai</code></td>
      <td><code>thinking_budget=N</code> + <code>include_thoughts=True</code></td>
      <td><code>thinking_budget=0</code></td>
      <td>沒 <code>include_thoughts</code> 的話 reasoning 不會出現在 response，<code>metadata.reasoning</code> 會空</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>anthropic</code></td>
      <td><code>thinking={"type":"enabled","budget_tokens":N}</code></td>
      <td>不傳 thinking kwarg</td>
      <td>API 強制要求 <code>budget_tokens ≥ 1024</code> 且 <code>temperature == 1.0</code>，否則 HTTP 400</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>openai</code></td>
      <td><code>reasoning={"effort":"medium","summary":"auto"}</code> + <code>use_responses_api=True</code></td>
      <td>不傳 reasoning kwarg</td>
      <td>少 <code>summary="auto"</code> 的話 gpt-5 不會 emit reasoning content_blocks</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>任一 + <code>reasoning="unsupported"</code></td>
      <td colspan="2" style="text-align:center"><em>完全不傳 reasoning kwarg</em></td>
      <td>給 gemini-1.5 / 不支援 thinking 的 model 用，避免 SDK reject 整個 init</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/agents/base.py · _init_model</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge new">+ new function</span>
      <span class="badge modified">in modified file</span>
      <span class="lang">Python</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-python">def _init_model(config: ModelConfig) -> BaseChatModel:
    name = config.name
    provider = _provider_prefix(name)
    kwargs: dict[str, Any] = {"temperature": config.temperature}

    if config.reasoning == "unsupported":
        return init_chat_model(name, **kwargs)        # 完全不碰 reasoning kwarg

    if provider == "google_genai":
        kwargs["thinking_budget"] = (
            config.thinking_budget if config.reasoning == "on" else 0
        )
        if config.reasoning == "on":
            kwargs["include_thoughts"] = True         # 不加的話 reasoning 不會回來

    elif provider == "anthropic":
        if config.reasoning == "on":
            if config.thinking_budget is None or config.thinking_budget < 1024:
                raise ValueError("Anthropic requires thinking_budget >= 1024")
            if config.temperature != 1.0:
                raise ValueError("Anthropic extended thinking requires temperature=1.0")
            kwargs["thinking"] = {"type": "enabled", "budget_tokens": config.thinking_budget}

    else:  # openai (含 bare names)
        if config.reasoning == "on":
            kwargs["reasoning"] = {"effort": "medium", "summary": "auto"}
            kwargs["use_responses_api"] = True

    return init_chat_model(name, **kwargs)</code></pre>
</div>

<p>對應 agent yaml 長相：</p>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">backend/agent_engine/agents/versions/v1_baseline/orchestrator_config.yaml</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">YAML</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-yaml">version: "0.1.0"
name: "v1_baseline"
description: "Naive single-chain financial analysis with basic tool access"

tools:
  - yfinance_stock_quote
  - tavily_financial_search
  - sec_filing_list_sections
  - sec_filing_get_section

model:
  name: "openai:gpt-5-mini"      # provider:model — admin-configured
  temperature: 0.0
  reasoning: "on"                # → reasoning={effort, summary} + responses API
  thinking_budget: null          # OpenAI 不用這個欄位，留 null

constraints:
  max_tool_calls_per_run: 10</code></pre>
