</section>

<section id="s5">
<h2 id="frontend"><span class="sec-num">§5</span>Frontend Walkthrough</h2>

<!-- ----------- useReasoningStatus ----------- -->
<h3 id="use-reasoning-status"><code>useReasoningStatus</code> — race-guarded ephemeral state</h3>

<p>
  整顆 hook 解三個競態問題（D31）：
</p>

<ol>
  <li><strong>Clear race：</strong>User 按「Clear」清空對話時，網路上可能還有 in-flight SSE 在 drain，這些 late event 不能再寫回 UI。用 <code>clearedRef</code> 鎖定。</li>
  <li><strong>Finished ghost：</strong><code>finish</code> / <code>error</code> 事件抵達後，backend 仍有可能 emit 一個 late <code>data-reasoning-status</code>（dev flag <code>EMIT_LATE_REASONING</code> 模擬此情境）。用 <code>finishedRef</code> 鎖定。</li>
  <li><strong>Stalled 模式：</strong>10 秒沒收到新 reasoning chunk → 視覺切到 stalled（變淡 + 慢動畫），讓使用者知道「系統還活著只是慢」。</li>
</ol>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/hooks/useReasoningStatus.ts</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+100</span>
      <span class="badge new">+ new file</span>
      <span class="lang">TypeScript</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-typescript">export const STALLED_THRESHOLD_MS = 10_000;

export function useReasoningStatus() {
  const [reasoningStatusText, setText] = useState&lt;string | null&gt;(null);
  const [stalled, setStalled] = useState(false);
  // 用 ref 不用 state — synchronous handleData 要能立刻 short-circuit
  // 而不必等下一個 render
  const clearedRef = useRef(false);
  const finishedRef = useRef(false);
  const lastUpdateAtRef = useRef&lt;number&gt;(0);

  const handleData = useCallback((part: ReasoningStatusDataPart) =&gt; {
    if (clearedRef.current || finishedRef.current) return;   // 雙重 race guard

    switch (part.type) {
      case "data-reasoning-status": {
        if (typeof part.data?.text === "string") {
          setText(part.data.text);
          lastUpdateAtRef.current = Date.now();
          setStalled(false);
        }
        return;
      }
      case "finish":
      case "error": {
        setText(null);
        setStalled(false);
        finishedRef.current = true;     // 把開關鎖上，後續 late 事件全丟
        return;
      }
      default: return;
    }
  }, []);

  // 兩種 cleanup verb（語意不同）:
  //   hideReasoningStatus()  — 只清文字，不鎖 ref（下一個 LLM call 可以再用）
  //   clearReasoningStatus() — 清文字 + 鎖 clearedRef（user 顯式 clear）
  const hideReasoningStatus = useCallback(() =&gt; {
    setText(null);
    setStalled(false);
  }, []);

  const clearReasoningStatus = useCallback(() =&gt; {
    setText(null);
    setStalled(false);
    clearedRef.current = true;
  }, []);

  const resetForNewTurn = useCallback(() =&gt; {
    setText(null);
    setStalled(false);
    clearedRef.current = false;
    finishedRef.current = false;
  }, []);

  // stalled 偵測 — 只有有 text 時才開計時器，省 wakeup
  useEffect(() =&gt; {
    if (reasoningStatusText === null) return;
    const id = setInterval(() =&gt; {
      if (Date.now() - lastUpdateAtRef.current &gt; STALLED_THRESHOLD_MS) {
        setStalled(true);
      }
    }, 1_000);
    return () =&gt; clearInterval(id);
  }, [reasoningStatusText]);

  return {
    reasoningStatusText, stalled, handleData,
    hideReasoningStatus, clearReasoningStatus, resetForNewTurn,
  };
}</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="callout">
  <span class="label">Review point</span>
  注意 <code>hideReasoningStatus</code> vs <code>clearReasoningStatus</code> 的 <strong>語意分離</strong> —
  Mid-turn 接到 text / tool 時用 <code>hideReasoningStatus()</code>（下一個 LLM call 還能再亮）；
  User 真的清對話才用 <code>clearReasoningStatus()</code>（鎖 ref，把整個 turn 的 late 事件全擋掉）。
  混用會導致下一輪 LLM 的 reasoning 完全不顯示，是看起來不像 bug 的 bug。
</div>

<div class="review-bubble blocking">
  <div class="anchor">useReasoningStatus.ts · 兩個 ref 語意</div>
  <span class="rb-label">Naming concern</span>
  <strong><code>hideReasoningStatus</code> / <code>clearReasoningStatus</code> 兩個名字太接近，誤用幾乎不會被 code review 抓到。</strong>
  建議 reviewer 確認：(a) 函式 JSDoc 是否明寫「mid-turn 用 hide / explicit clear 才用 clear」？(b) Hook 的 unit test (<code>useReasoningStatus.test.ts</code>) 是否覆蓋「clear 之後 mid-turn 的 reasoning 應該被 drop」這個情境？兩者語意若考慮 rename 為 <code>hideForNextCall</code> / <code>blockUntilNewTurn</code> 之類更直白的名字會更安全，但會改動所有 callsite。
</div>

<div class="review-bubble note">
  <div class="anchor">useReasoningStatus.ts · stalled timer 只在有 text 時跑</div>
  <span class="rb-label">note</span>
  <code>useEffect</code> 只在 <code>reasoningStatusText !== null</code> 時起 <code>setInterval</code> — idle 狀態下不會每秒 wake up 一次燒電。Polling 細微到只看 <code>lastUpdateAtRef</code>（ref，不是 state），所以每次 tick 不會 re-render；只有當 <code>setStalled(true)</code> 真的觸發才 re-render 一次。</div>

<!-- ----------- ReasoningIndicator ----------- -->
<h3 id="reasoning-indicator"><code>ReasoningIndicator</code> — 3 modes, vertical-slot 對齊</h3>

<p>同一個 <code>.reasoning-status</code> 容器渲染三種 mode，共用同一個垂直 slot 高度（<code>height: calc(0.72rem * 1.5)</code>），mode 之間切換不會有畫面跳動。</p>

<div class="diff-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/components/atoms/ReasoningIndicator.tsx</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+58</span>
      <span class="stat rem">−5</span>
      <span class="badge modified">rewrite</span>
      <span class="lang">TSX</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre data-diff data-lang="typescript">-export function ReasoningIndicator() {
+interface ReasoningIndicatorProps {
+  text?: string | null;
+  state?: "streaming" | "frozen";
+  stalled?: boolean;
+}
+
+// The reasoning text from `data-reasoning-status` events tends to arrive
+// with a trailing sentence-ending punctuation. Strip the trailing
+// whitespace + punctuation so the cycler dots flow naturally.
+function trimTrailingDelim(text: string): string {
+  return text.replace(/[.,;:!?。，；：！？、…\s]+$/u, "");
+}
+
+export function ReasoningIndicator({
+  text,
+  state = "streaming",
+  stalled = false,
+}: ReasoningIndicatorProps = {}) {
+  const wrapperClass = stalled ? "reasoning-status stalled" : "reasoning-status";
+  const displayText = typeof text === "string" ? trimTrailingDelim(text) : text;
+
+  // Frozen-without-text — Stop-A (abort during pre-response idle).
+  if (!displayText && state === "frozen") {
+    return (
+      &lt;div data-testid="reasoning-indicator" className={wrapperClass} aria-hidden="true"&gt;
+        &lt;span className="reasoning-status-frozen-label"&gt;STOPPED&lt;/span&gt;
+      &lt;/div&gt;
+    );
+  }
+
+  if (!displayText) {
+    return (
+      &lt;div data-testid="reasoning-indicator" className={wrapperClass} aria-hidden="true"&gt;
+        &lt;span className="idle-dots"&gt;
+          &lt;span /&gt;
+          &lt;span /&gt;
+          &lt;span /&gt;
+        &lt;/span&gt;
+      &lt;/div&gt;
+    );
+  }
+
+  if (state === "frozen") {
+    return (
+      &lt;div data-testid="reasoning-indicator" className={wrapperClass} aria-hidden="true"&gt;
+        &lt;span className="reasoning-status-text" style={{ opacity: 0.65 }}&gt;
+          {displayText}
+        &lt;/span&gt;
+        &lt;span className="reasoning-status-frozen-label"&gt;STOPPED&lt;/span&gt;
+      &lt;/div&gt;
+    );
+  }
+
   return (
-    &lt;div data-testid="reasoning-indicator" className="flex items-center gap-1 py-4 px-2"&gt;
-      {[0, 1, 2].map((i) =&gt; (
-        &lt;span
-          key={i}
-          className="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground animate-bounce"
-          style={{ animationDelay: `${i * 150}ms` }}
-        /&gt;
-      ))}
+    &lt;div data-testid="reasoning-indicator" className={wrapperClass} aria-hidden="true"&gt;
+      &lt;span className="reasoning-status-text"&gt;{displayText}&lt;/span&gt;
+      &lt;span className="reasoning-status-dots-cycler" /&gt;
     &lt;/div&gt;
   );
 }</pre>
</div>

<div class="callout warn">
  <span class="label">為什麼這顆 component 整顆 rewrite</span>
  舊版只有<strong>單一 mode</strong>：永遠 3 個跳動點，不接受任何 prop。
  新版接 3 個 prop（<code>text / state / stalled</code>）並 render 4 種視覺分支：
  idle（無 text）、streaming（text + cycler）、frozen-with-text（半透明 + STOPPED）、frozen-no-text（純 STOPPED label）。
  搭配 <code>aria-hidden="true"</code> 讓 SR 不會逐字唸這些 ephemeral 文字。
</div>

<p><strong>注意 <code>aria-hidden="true"</code></strong> — 三個分支都掛這個 attr。
  Reasoning 文字屬於視覺裝飾，screen reader 不應該逐句唸；真正的 transition announcement 由 <code>LiveStatusAnnouncer</code> 統一發。</p>

<!-- ----------- indicator-logic ----------- -->
<h3 id="indicator-logic"><code>reasoning-indicator-logic.ts</code> — pure selectors</h3>

<p>
  Hook 跟 message 結構解耦：所有「該不該顯示」「該顯示什麼字」的判斷都集中在這個檔的 pure function 裡，
  方便單元測試（不用 mock <code>lastMessage</code>）。
</p>

<div class="diff-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/lib/reasoning-indicator-logic.ts</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+67</span>
      <span class="stat rem">−5</span>
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">TS</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre data-diff data-lang="typescript">-import type { ChatStatus } from "@/models";
+import { isRunningToolState, type ChatStatus } from "@/models";
 import type { UIMessage } from "@ai-sdk/react";

+export const IDLE_SYNTHESIZING_TEXT = "Synthesizing";
+export const IDLE_THINKING_TEXT = "Thinking";  // reserved for D15 heuristic
+
 /**
  * Whether the "AI is reasoning" dot indicator should appear.
  *
  * The indicator fills the pre-response gap — after the user sends a
  * turn but before the assistant has streamed anything visible. Once
  * any part (text / tool) lands in the last assistant message, the
- * inline `Cursor` takes over at the tail of the Markdown, so we
- * suppress the separate indicator to avoid double-signaling.
+ * inline `Cursor` (text part) or `ToolCard` running state takes over,
+ * so we suppress the separate indicator to avoid double-signaling.
+ *
+ * Visibility table (status streaming, last part):
+ *   - text part                  → false
+ *   - tool part still running    → false
+ *   - tool part completed        → true  (post-tool gap; D15 §7.4)
+ *   - parts empty                → true  (3-dot pre-response idle)
+ *   - reasoningStatusText truthy → true  (real reasoning text)
  */
 export function shouldShowReasoningIndicator(args: {
   status: ChatStatus;
   lastMessage: Pick&lt;UIMessage, "role" | "parts"&gt; | null;
+  reasoningStatusText: string | null;
 }): boolean {
-  const { status, lastMessage } = args;
+  const { status, lastMessage, reasoningStatusText } = args;

   if (status === "ready" || status === "error") return false;

   if (!lastMessage || lastMessage.role !== "assistant") return true;

-  return lastMessage.parts.length === 0;
+  const lastPart = lastMessage.parts.at(-1);
+  if (lastPart) {
+    const t = lastPart.type;
+    if (t === "text") return false;
+    if (typeof t === "string" && (t.startsWith("tool-") || t === "dynamic-tool")) {
+      return isCompletedToolPart(lastPart) && status === "streaming";
+    }
+  }
+
+  if (reasoningStatusText) return true;
+  if (lastMessage.parts.length === 0) return true;
+  return false;
+}
+
+/**
+ * Resolve the display text for the reasoning indicator.
+ *
+ * Precedence (D15 §7.4):
+ *  1. Real reasoning status text passes through verbatim.
+ *  2. Streaming + completed tool last part → idle "Synthesizing".
+ *  3. Otherwise null.
+ */
+export function resolveReasoningDisplayText(args: {
+  reasoningStatusText: string | null;
+  status: ChatStatus;
+  lastMessage: Pick&lt;UIMessage, "role" | "parts"&gt; | null;
+}): string | null {
+  const { reasoningStatusText, status, lastMessage } = args;
+
+  if (reasoningStatusText) return reasoningStatusText;
+  if (status !== "streaming") return null;
+  if (!lastMessage || lastMessage.role !== "assistant") return null;
+
+  const lastPart = lastMessage.parts.at(-1);
+  if (lastPart && isCompletedToolPart(lastPart)) return IDLE_SYNTHESIZING_TEXT;
+
+  return null;
+}
+
+function isCompletedToolPart(part: { type?: unknown; state?: unknown }): boolean {
+  if (typeof part.type !== "string") return false;
+  if (!part.type.startsWith("tool-") &amp;&amp; part.type !== "dynamic-tool") return false;
+  return !isRunningToolState(part.state as string);
 }</pre>
</div>

<!-- ----------- ChatPanel ----------- -->
<h3 id="chat-panel"><code>ChatPanel</code> — wire 全部 hook + 處理 abort 凍結</h3>

<p>
  AI SDK v6 把 SSE 切成三條路：<code>onData</code> 只收 <code>data-*</code> chunk，<code>onFinish</code> 收 <code>finish</code> chunk，<code>onError</code> 收 <code>error</code> chunk。
  generic events（<code>start</code>, <code>text-*</code>, <code>tool-*</code>）走 state callback，不會經過 <code>onData</code>。
  這顆 commit 把這三條路全部接好。
</p>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/components/pages/ChatPanel.tsx · useChat wiring</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">TSX</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-typescript">const onData = useCallback((dataPart: { type: string; ... }) =&gt; {
  toolProgressHandleData(dataPart);
  handleReasoningData(dataPart);
}, [toolProgressHandleData, handleReasoningData]);

const { messages, ..., status, error } = useChat({
  id: chatId, transport, onData,

  onFinish: ({ isAbort, isDisconnect, isError }) =&gt; {
    // 不管哪種 finish，都先 latch finishedRef
    handleReasoningData({ type: "finish" });

    // 只有自然 finish 才送 "Response complete" SR announcement
    //   isAbort      → 由 frozen STOPPED indicator 表示
    //   isDisconnect → status === "error" 已接管
    //   isError      → status === "error" 已接管
    if (isAbort || isDisconnect || isError) return;
    setLastSSEEvent({ type: "finish" });
  },

  onError: () =&gt; {
    handleReasoningData({ type: "error" });  // 一樣 latch
  },
});</code></pre>
</div>

<p><strong>Stop button handler 把當下的 reasoning text 凍結進 message-level state：</strong></p>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/components/pages/ChatPanel.tsx · handleStop</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge new">+ new logic</span>
      <span class="lang">TSX</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-typescript">const handleStop = useCallback(() =&gt; {
  const lastMsg = messages.at(-1);
  // 標記所有還在跑的 tool 為 aborted
  const runningIds: ToolCallId[] = [];
  if (lastMsg && lastMsg.role === "assistant") {
    for (const p of lastMsg.parts) {
      if (isToolPart(p) && isRunningToolState(p.state as string)) {
        runningIds.push(getToolCallId(p));
      }
    }
  }
  if (runningIds.length) setAbortedTools(prev =&gt; new Set([...prev, ...runningIds]));

  // C1：reasoning indicator 是 ephemeral 的，不會進 message.parts。
  // 為了讓 STOPPED 標籤跨後續 turn 還能黏在這條 bubble 上，
  // 用 abortedMessages Map 凍結當下的 reasoning text。
  if (lastMsg && lastMsg.role === "assistant") {
    const captured = reasoningStatusText;   // 可能是 null (Stop-A)
    setAbortedMessages(prev =&gt; new Map(prev).set(lastMsg.id, { frozenReasoningText: captured }));
  }

  // hide 不 clear — clearReasoningStatus 會鎖 clearedRef
  // 害下一個 turn 完全看不到 reasoning
  hideReasoningStatus();
  stop();
}, [messages, stop, hideReasoningStatus, reasoningStatusText]);</code></pre>
</div>

<p><strong><code>useLayoutEffect</code> 在新 part 抵達時清除 reasoning indicator：</strong></p>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/components/pages/ChatPanel.tsx · auto-hide layoutEffect</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge new">+ new effect</span>
      <span class="lang">TSX</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-typescript">// AI SDK v6 generic SSE events (text-start, tool-*) 不走 onData，
// 所以 reasoning hook 自己看不到「該清掉了」訊號。改用 messages array 監視。
//
// Trigger 是 "parts.length 變多"，不是 "last part 是 text/tool"。
// Tool state transition (input-streaming → output-available) 跟
// post-tool synthesizing 空窗 都不會讓 parts.length 改變 — 不能誤清。
const prevAssistantRef = useRef&lt;{ id: string | null; partsCount: number }&gt;({ id: null, partsCount: 0 });
useLayoutEffect(() =&gt; {
  const lastMsg = messages.at(-1);
  if (!lastMsg || lastMsg.role !== "assistant") {
    prevAssistantRef.current = { id: null, partsCount: 0 };
    return;
  }
  const prev = prevAssistantRef.current;
  const prevCount = (prev.id === lastMsg.id) ? prev.partsCount : 0;
  const currCount = (lastMsg.parts as PartLike[]).length;
  prevAssistantRef.current = { id: lastMsg.id, partsCount: currCount };
  if (currCount &gt; prevCount) hideReasoningStatus();
}, [messages, hideReasoningStatus]);</code></pre>
</div>

<!-- ----------- AssistantMessage ----------- -->
<h3 id="assistant-message"><code>AssistantMessage</code> — D39.b defense-in-depth filter</h3>

<p>
  即使 backend 的 <code>transient: true</code> contract 全部正常運作，前端仍然多加一道 filter：
  在 render <code>parts</code> 之前把所有 <code>type</code> 開頭是 <code>"data-reasoning-"</code> 的 part 過濾掉。
  萬一 backend transient flag 被 dev 改錯（<code>FORCE_REASONING_NON_TRANSIENT</code> 模擬），
  reasoning 也不會洩漏進 transcript（不會被 AI markdown 渲染、不會被 history replay）。
</p>

<div class="diff-card">
