<!-- ----------- LiveAnnouncer ----------- -->
<h3 id="live-announcer"><code>LiveStatusAnnouncer</code> — ARIA hybrid</h3>

<p>
  視覺指示器掛 <code>aria-hidden="true"</code> 不被 SR 唸；轉場狀態（finish / error）由獨立的 <code>role="status" aria-live="polite"</code> 元素統一發音，避免逐句 reasoning 把 polite queue 灌爆。
</p>

<div class="two-col">
<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/components/atoms/LiveStatusAnnouncer.tsx</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+28</span>
      <span class="badge new">+ new file</span>
      <span class="lang">TSX</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-typescript">export function LiveStatusAnnouncer({ status, lastEvent }: ...) {
  const text = formatStatusText(status, lastEvent);
  return (
    &lt;div role="status" aria-live="polite" className="sr-only"&gt;
      {text}
    &lt;/div&gt;
  );
}</code></pre>
</div>
<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/components/atoms/live-status-text.ts</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+29</span>
      <span class="badge new">+ new file</span>
      <span class="lang">TypeScript</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-typescript">export function formatStatusText(
  status: ChatStatus,
  lastEvent: AnnouncedEvent | null,
): string {
  // status === "error" always wins — 即使 lastEvent 是 finish
  if (status === "error") {
    const detail = lastEvent?.errorText ?? "stream interrupted";
    return `Error: ${detail}`;
  }
  if (!lastEvent) return "";
  if (lastEvent.type === "finish") return "Response complete";
  return "";
}</code></pre>
</div>
</div>

<!-- ----------- CSS ----------- -->
<h3 id="variant-a-css">Variant A CSS — vertical-slot 對齊</h3>

<p>三個 mode 共用同一高度，避免切換時畫面跳動。<code>.reasoning-status-text</code> 用 <code>flex: 0 1 auto</code> 而非 <code>flex: 1</code> — 讓 cycler dots 緊貼在最後一個字後面，而不是被推到 row 最右邊。</p>

<div class="code-card">
  <div class="code-head">
    <span class="filename">frontend/src/index.css</span>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="stat add">+132</span>
      <span class="badge modified">modified</span>
      <span class="lang">CSS</span>
    </div>
  </div>
<pre><code class="language-css">.reasoning-status {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  padding: 4px 12px 6px;
  margin-top: -8px;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--muted-foreground);
  height: calc(0.72rem * 1.5);    /* 三 mode 同高，無垂直 jump */
}

.reasoning-status-text {
  /* Bug A: flex:1 會把 dots 推到 row 最右邊；改 flex:0 1 auto 後 dots 黏在最後字 */
  flex: 0 1 auto;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;             /* D21 hard-clip — 長句不換行 */
}

.reasoning-status-dots-cycler::after {
  content: "";
  animation: reasoning-dots-cycle 1.2s steps(4, end) infinite;
}

@keyframes reasoning-dots-cycle {
  0%   { content: ""; }
  25%  { content: "."; }
  50%  { content: ".."; }
  75%  { content: "..."; }
  100% { content: ""; }
}</code></pre>
</div>

